OL,10,     Fsevered four toes while mowing the
OL,11,     Flawn.
OL,12,G0230 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FSammy, who's 16, has anorexia
OL,14,     Fnervosa. She's in paediatrics with
OL,15,     Fdangerously low blood pressure.
OL,16,     FCarpenter Ray, who's 66, fell onto
OL,17,     Fconcrete while working on a
OL,18,     Fbuilding site.
